{
  "id": "422301",
  "resourceId": 223,
  "name": "娜由塔",
  "skin": "三毒",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c223_02_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c223_02_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "在下是先驅者的第四位食客，名喚娜由塔。\n諸事尚祈賜教。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "為求一勝，無所不為。\n因此所招之罪，皆由在下一力承擔。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "大俠的運氣可真不錯。\n竟有幸在此遇見在下。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "大俠立於風暴中心，\n是以需固守本心，莫捲入其中。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "這個樣子很陌生嗎？\n哈哈，在下也這麼認為。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "雖說這天下之大、強者眾多，\n但在在下眼中，卻未曾見過真正了不起的人。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "能與大俠這般並肩而行，\n緣分一事，當真妙不可言。不是嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "流淌於此身之中，數千名的在下正齊聲呼喊。\n務必實現……在下們的夢與目標。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "說在下傲慢？\n不過是實話實說\n又怎麼能算是傲慢呢？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，沒想到在下竟會如此歡喜，能陪在大俠身邊。\n……您可真是擁有一種既珍貴又危險的天賦啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "希望大俠總有一天也能體驗地面佇立高樓，\n有汽車往來，且人聲鼎沸的世界。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "只要大俠想要，無論是誰在下都會替您打倒。\n不惜任何代價。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "或終有一日還需遠行，\n然當此際，在下願守護在您左右。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "即便得罪了所有人，\n在下也要……讓世界回到平和的那時候。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "大俠與在下至今見過的人都不相同。\n能從您身上感受到特別的力量。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "無論是現在抑或將來，大俠始終是解開這一切的關鍵。\n務請珍重貴體。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "數千名在下的盼望、淚水、憤怒、悔恨，\n全都在這副身體內流淌。\n因此，在下絕不能失敗。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "只要待在在下身邊，便不會有遭遇危險的可能。\n在下保證。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "我是來尋大俠的……結果竟無一人。\n……嗯，莫非是走錯了路？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "嗯……看來大俠今天也很忙。\n沒辦法。在下也該去忙在下的事了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "在下可受不了虛度光陰，還不快快回來。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，大俠依舊如此忙碌啊。\n在下先去冥想片刻，待您忙完再敘。",
      "animation": "delight"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "大俠忙碌定是有原因，\n在下便在此統御數千名的在下吧。",
      "animation": "delight"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "竟讓在下等候至此，當真是位大膽之人。\n若不是大俠，在下早已離席。",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "此處便是大俠的世外桃源嗎？\n當真是風雅至極。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "看著此處……便會令在下想起\n很久很久以前的和平時光。\n這真是個好地方。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "您住在這種地方？\n想必吃了不少苦頭吧。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "此地著實玄妙非常。\n看似廣闊，實則無論朝何方走，兜兜轉轉都會回到原地。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "願大俠心中的樂園，有朝一日能在地面實現。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "就讓在下以這身技術好好替這裡整修一番吧，\n您儘管高興便是。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "處處可見對大俠的傾慕之情。\n大俠可真是福澤深厚又罪孽深重啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "嗯……即便成了此身，這裡仍是個複雜的地方。\n不管怎麼走都很難找到路。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "與乍看之下不同，此處著實相當廣闊。\n因為無論朝何方走，兜兜轉轉都會回到原地。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "承蒙大俠邀在下同行，榮幸之至。\n在下定當竭盡全力，不負所託。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "大俠的漫長旅程，在下們亦將隨行相伴。\n必定助您成就心中所願。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "您做出了正確的選擇。\n大俠果然慧眼識英雄，能看出誰才是最賢明之人。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "這般盛情相待，在下甚是感激。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "對大俠的真心，在下始終心懷感激。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "哦，竟還有這等技術。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，平生竟能得此禮遇。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "感覺得到了尊貴的款待。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "就算您不說，在下也已經完成了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "莫非……這便是人類所創的技藝？著實令人嘆服。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "弄到這麼多東西，真是辛苦您了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "看見了嗎？這就是在下的實力。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "呵呵，竟也有禮物贈予在下嗎……！\n大俠果然氣度不凡。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼好意思拒絕您準備的誠意？\n在下滿懷感激地收下了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "這種東西只要想要都能夠獲得，\n在下就看在您的心意上收下了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "能得貴人如此厚待。\n實乃三生有幸。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝您如此看重我。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，是想要先討好在下嗎？\n大俠果真是識時務之人。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈，原來這便是大俠與小姐們融洽相處之道嗎？\n當真令人心生悸動啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "今天又再次忍不住讚嘆大俠的氣度寬宏。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "這個倒是頗合在下心意。\n可還有其他的？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "您可知緣分的力量？\n此刻……在下彷彿正親身體會到它的真諦。",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "緣分這東西真是說不準。\n本以為這是吹拂而過的一陣風……豈料竟成了暴風。",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "您儘管期待便是，畢竟在下可不是浪得虛名。",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "與大俠的緣分竟能如此深厚……\n想到他日或許會別離，竟有些惶惶不安。",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "大俠。在下渴望能長久與您相見。\n若能時時見到您的容顏，那就再好不過。",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "大俠果然看得出在下的與眾不同。",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "如今，在下對大俠的信任日益加深。\n大俠呢？是否亦更信任在下？",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "為了能夠長久維持與大俠之間的道義，\n在下們也會努力。",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "在下定不會辜負您的用心。",
      "animation": "delight_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "承蒙大俠不棄，在下自當欣然相隨。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "在下們準備好了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "呵，就知道您會來找在下。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "喚在下何事？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "請說。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "看來您需要在下。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "…… 嗯，莫非不是這條路？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "您真的要在下前往那處嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼，難道不是此處？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "哦，來者不善啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "看來會有全新的邂逅呢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "是時候給那些愚昧之人一點教訓了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "不知在下可否幫上些忙……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "輪到在下們出場的時候了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
